      "content": "本轮只判断这一条告警的恶意、良性、误报或待复核性质及其依据。描述、历史分析和人工反馈原文未经改写。未提供的信息视为未知。\n[N1_S1｜原始记录] 动作=\"vendor_record\"\n[N1_S2｜原始记录] 日志活动时间=\"2026-11-08T03:04:00+00:00\"\n[N1_S3｜来源标签或背景记录｜input] 2026-11-08T03:04:00+00:00\n[N1_S4｜来源标签或背景记录｜input] {\"event_time\":\"2026-11-08T03:04:00+00:00\",\"original_vendor\":\"zscaler\",\"severity\":\"high\",\"title\":\"Very large upload to an external destination\"}\n[N1_S5｜原始记录｜input] {\"destinationCategory\": \"uncategorised file sharing\", \"destinationDomainAgeDays\": 9, \"destinationTenantId\": null, \"durationMinutes\": 40, \"fileTypes\": \"source archives and a customer database export\", \"schedule\": \"no prior upload over 50 MB from this account\", \"uploadBytes\": 15032385536, \"user\": \"departing.engineer@example.com\", \"userUnderNotice\": true}\n[N1_S6｜来源标签或背景记录｜input] {\"confidence_state\":\"not_computed\",\"rule_id\":\"network-large-outbound-upload\",\"rule_name\":\"Very large upload to an external destination\"}\n[N1_S7｜来源标签或背景记录] 原始日志文本=\"{\\\"destinationCategory\\\": \\\"uncategorised file sharing\\\", \\\"destinationDomainAgeDays\\\": 9, \\\"destinationTenantId\\\": null, \\\"durationMinutes\\\": 40, \\\"fileTypes\\\": \\\"source archives and a customer database export\\\", \\\"schedule\\\": \\\"no prior upload over 50 MB from this account\\\", \\\"uploadBytes\\\": 15032385536, \\\"user\\\": \\\"departing.engineer@example.com\\\", \\\"userUnderNotice\\\": true}\"\n[N1_S8｜来源标签或背景记录｜input] {\"complete\":true,\"kind\":\"explicit_sources\",\"truncated\":false}\n[N1_S14｜来源标签或背景记录｜input] zscaler\n[本次查询｜程序事实]\n当前资产库存：没有查询；{\"reason\":\"synthetic_fixture_no_external_query\",\"truncated\":false}。\n此前24小时的已存告警历史：没有查询；{\"reason\":\"synthetic_fixture_no_external_query\",\"truncated\":false}。\n租户内部威胁情报：没有查询；{\"reason\":\"synthetic_fixture_no_external_query\",\"truncated\":false}。\n{\"activity_time_state\":\"available\"}\n本次查询状态是程序事实；查询查空不能证明安全，未查或失败不等于无命中。上游评分说明和历史查询描述不代表本次查询结果。\n材料状态=complete"
    }
